{
 "unidades": [
  {
   "id": "u03",
   "titulo": {"es": "ou y u", "en": "ou and u"},
   "objetivo": {"es": "Distinguir ou de loup (la «u» del español) y u de lune (un sonido nuevo): tu/tout, vu/vous, rue/roue.", "en": "Tell apart ou as in loup (like oo in moon) and u as in lune (a new sound): tu/tout, vu/vous, rue/roue."},
   "lecciones": [
    {
     "id": "u03.l01",
     "titulo": {"es": "ou de loup", "en": "ou as in loup"},
     "pasos": [
      {"tipo": "lumo", "pose": "anima", "texto": {"es": "En francés, ou se lee como la «u» del español. Loup (lobo) se escribe con dos letras, o y u, pero tiene un solo sonido.", "en": "In French, ou sounds like the oo in moon. Loup (wolf) is written with two letters, o and u, but it's just one sound."}},
      {"tipo": "mira", "m": "l(ou:ou)(p:_)", "sonido": "ou", "texto": {"es": "La ou azul de loup suena como la u de luna. La p del final no suena.", "en": "The blue ou of loup sounds like the oo in moon. The final p is silent."}},
      {"tipo": "escucha", "palabras": [{"m": "l(ou:ou)(p:_)", "e": "1f43a", "t": {"es": "lobo", "en": "wolf"}}, {"m": "s(ou:ou)p(e:_)", "e": "1f372", "t": {"es": "sopa", "en": "soup"}}, {"m": "r(ou:ou)(e:_)", "e": "1f6de", "t": {"es": "rueda", "en": "wheel"}}, {"m": "p(ou:ou)l(e:_)", "e": "1f414", "t": {"es": "gallina", "en": "hen"}}]},
      {"tipo": "mezcla", "m": "s(ou:ou)p(e:_)", "t": {"es": "sopa", "en": "soup"}},
      {"tipo": "toca_sonido", "sonido": "ou", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Cuál tiene la ou de loup?", "en": "Which one has the ou in loup?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "p(ou:ou)l(e:_)", "e": "1f414"}, {"m": "l(i:i)(t:_)", "e": "1f6cf"}, {"m": "(ch:=)(a:a)(t:_)", "e": "1f431"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "loupe", "pregunta": {"es": "¿loup o loupe?", "en": "loup or loupe?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "l(ou:ou)(p:_)", "e": "1f43a"}, {"m": "l(ou:ou)p(e:_)", "e": "1f50d"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "construye", "m": "s(ou:ou)p(e:_)", "fichas": ["s", "o", "u", "p", "e", "a"]},
      {"tipo": "cambia", "de": "n(ou:ou)(s:_)", "a": "v(ou:ou)(s:_)", "opciones": ["n", "v", "t"]},
      {"tipo": "repite", "m": "l(ou:ou)(p:_)", "t": {"es": "lobo", "en": "wolf"}}
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "u03.l02",
     "titulo": {"es": "u de lune", "en": "u as in lune"},
     "pasos": [
      {"tipo": "mira", "m": "l(u:u)n(e:_)", "sonido": "u", "texto": {"es": "Este sonido no existe en español. Di «i» y, sin mover la lengua, redondea los labios como para «u».", "en": "English doesn't have this sound. Say “ee” and, without moving your tongue, round your lips as if for “oo”."}},
      {"tipo": "escucha", "palabras": [{"m": "l(u:u)n(e:_)", "e": "1f319", "t": {"es": "luna", "en": "moon"}}, {"m": "b(u:u)s", "e": "1f68c", "t": {"es": "bus", "en": "bus"}}, {"m": "t(u:u)l(i:i)p(e:_)", "e": "1f337", "t": {"es": "tulipán", "en": "tulip"}}, {"m": "pl(u:u)m(e:_)", "e": "1fab6", "t": {"es": "pluma", "en": "feather"}}]},
      {"tipo": "lumo", "pose": "pensando", "texto": {"es": "Truco: labios de «u», lengua de «i». Si te sale la «u» del español, eso es ou, no u.", "en": "Trick: lips of “oo”, tongue of “ee”. If you end up saying a plain “oo”, that's ou, not u."}},
      {"tipo": "mezcla", "m": "t(u:u)", "t": {"es": "tú", "en": "you (informal)"}},
      {"tipo": "toca_sonido", "sonido": "u", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Cuál tiene la u de lune?", "en": "Which one has the u in lune?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "b(u:u)s", "e": "1f68c"}, {"m": "l(ou:ou)(p:_)", "e": "1f43a"}, {"m": "p(ou:ou)l(e:_)", "e": "1f414"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "toca_sonido", "sonido": "u", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Cuál tiene la u de lune?", "en": "Which one has the u in lune?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "r(ou:ou)(e:_)", "e": "1f6de"}, {"m": "pl(u:u)m(e:_)", "e": "1fab6"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "construye", "m": "b(u:u)s", "fichas": ["b", "u", "s", "o"]},
      {"tipo": "cambia", "de": "l(u:u)", "a": "v(u:u)", "opciones": ["l", "v", "t"]},
      {"tipo": "construye", "m": "l(u:u)n(e:_)", "fichas": ["l", "u", "n", "e", "o"]},
      {"tipo": "repite", "m": "l(u:u)n(e:_)", "t": {"es": "luna", "en": "moon"}}
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "u03.l03",
     "titulo": {"es": "¿tu o tout?", "en": "tu or tout?"},
     "pasos": [
      {"tipo": "lumo", "pose": "escucha", "texto": {"es": "Ahora el reto: una sola vocal cambia la palabra. Escucha bien: ou es la «u» del español; u es una «i» con labios redondos.", "en": "Now the challenge: a single vowel changes the word. Listen closely: ou is “oo”; u is “ee” with rounded lips."}},
      {"tipo": "escucha", "palabras": [{"m": "t(u:u)", "t": {"es": "tú", "en": "you (informal)"}}, {"m": "t(ou:ou)(t:_)", "t": {"es": "todo", "en": "all"}}, {"m": "v(u:u)", "t": {"es": "visto", "en": "seen"}}, {"m": "v(ou:ou)(s:_)", "t": {"es": "usted / ustedes", "en": "you (formal / plural)"}}]},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "tout", "pregunta": {"es": "¿tu o tout?", "en": "tu or tout?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "t(u:u)"}, {"m": "t(ou:ou)(t:_)"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "vu", "pregunta": {"es": "¿vu o vous?", "en": "vu or vous?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "v(u:u)"}, {"m": "v(ou:ou)(s:_)"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "roue", "pregunta": {"es": "¿rue o roue?", "en": "rue or roue?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "r(u:u)(e:_)"}, {"m": "r(ou:ou)(e:_)"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "su", "pregunta": {"es": "¿su o sous?", "en": "su or sous?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "s(u:u)"}, {"m": "s(ou:ou)(s:_)"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "loup", "pregunta": {"es": "¿lu o loup?", "en": "lu or loup?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "l(u:u)"}, {"m": "l(ou:ou)(p:_)"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "tu", "pregunta": {"es": "¿tu o tout?", "en": "tu or tout?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "t(ou:ou)(t:_)"}, {"m": "t(u:u)"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "cambia", "de": "l(u:u)n(e:_)", "a": "d(u:u)n(e:_)", "opciones": ["l", "d", "p"]},
      {"tipo": "repite", "m": "r(u:u)(e:_)", "t": {"es": "calle", "en": "street"}}
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "u03.l04",
     "titulo": {"es": "dessus, dessous", "en": "dessus, dessous"},
     "pasos": [
      {"tipo": "escucha", "palabras": [{"m": "d(e:schwa)(ss:=)(u:u)(s:_)", "t": {"es": "encima", "en": "above, on top"}}, {"m": "d(e:schwa)(ss:=)(ou:ou)(s:_)", "t": {"es": "debajo", "en": "below, underneath"}}, {"m": "s(a:a)l(u:u)(t:_)", "e": "1f44b", "t": {"es": "hola", "en": "hi"}}, {"m": "(u:u)n(e:_)", "t": {"es": "una", "en": "a, one"}}]},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "dessous", "pregunta": {"es": "¿dessus o dessous?", "en": "dessus or dessous?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "d(e:schwa)(ss:=)(u:u)(s:_)"}, {"m": "d(e:schwa)(ss:=)(ou:ou)(s:_)"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "toca_sonido", "sonido": "ou", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Cuál tiene la ou de loup?", "en": "Which one has the ou in loup?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "j(u:u)p(e:_)"}, {"m": "p(ou:ou)l(e:_)", "e": "1f414"}, {"m": "l(u:u)n(e:_)", "e": "1f319"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "construye", "m": "s(a:a)l(u:u)(t:_)", "fichas": ["s", "a", "l", "u", "t", "o"]},
      {"tipo": "lumo", "pose": "anima", "texto": {"es": "Con ou y u ya puedes leer frases. Toca cada palabra si necesitas oírla.", "en": "With ou and u you can already read sentences. Tap any word if you need to hear it."}},
      {"tipo": "lee", "m": "L(ou:ou) (a:a) v(u:u) l(a:a) l(u:u)n(e:_).", "t": {"es": "Lou vio la luna.", "en": "Lou saw the moon."}, "pregunta": {"es": "¿Qué vio Lou?", "en": "What did Lou see?"}, "opciones": [{"e": "1f319"}, {"e": "1f68c"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "lee", "m": "L(ou:ou) (a:a) (u:u)n(e:_) l(ou:ou)p(e:_).", "t": {"es": "Lou tiene una lupa.", "en": "Lou has a magnifying glass."}, "pregunta": {"es": "¿Qué tiene Lou?", "en": "What does Lou have?"}, "opciones": [{"e": "1f43a"}, {"e": "1f50d"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "lee", "m": "L(u:u)l(u:u) (a:a) v(u:u) l(a:a) p(ou:ou)l(e:_).", "t": {"es": "Lulú vio la gallina.", "en": "Lulu saw the hen."}, "pregunta": {"es": "¿Qué vio Lulú?", "en": "What did Lulu see?"}, "opciones": [{"e": "1f414"}, {"e": "1f337"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "repite", "m": "d(e:schwa)(ss:=)(ou:ou)(s:_)", "t": {"es": "debajo", "en": "below, underneath"}},
      {"tipo": "lumo", "pose": "celebra", "texto": {"es": "¡Ya distingues ou y u! Es el sonido más difícil para quien habla español, y lo lograste.", "en": "You can now tell ou and u apart! It's one of the trickiest sounds for English speakers, and you got it."}}
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "u04",
   "titulo": {"es": "Las e del francés", "en": "The French e's"},
   "objetivo": {"es": "Leer las tres e: é de bébé (también -er, -ez, et, les), è de fraise (è, ê, ai, ei) y la e suave de cheval (le, de, je).", "en": "Read the three e's: é as in bébé (also -er, -ez, et, les), è as in fraise (è, ê, ai, ei) and the soft e of cheval (le, de, je)."},
   "lecciones": [
    {
     "id": "u04.l01",
     "titulo": {"es": "é, -er, -ez, et", "en": "é, -er, -ez, et"},
     "pasos": [
      {"tipo": "lumo", "pose": "sorprendido", "texto": {"es": "El francés tiene tres «e» distintas. Hoy, la é de bébé: se escribe é, pero también -er, -ez y et.", "en": "French has three different “e” sounds. Today, the é of bébé: it's written é, but also -er, -ez and et."}},
      {"tipo": "mira", "m": "n(ez:e)", "sonido": "e", "texto": {"es": "En nez (nariz), ez suena como la é de bébé y la z no se oye. Al final de palabra, er también suena é: parler (hablar).", "en": "In nez (nose), ez sounds like the é of bébé and the z is silent. At the end of a word, er also sounds é: parler (to speak)."}},
      {"tipo": "escucha", "palabras": [{"m": "b(é:e)b(é:e)", "e": "1f476", "t": {"es": "bebé", "en": "baby"}}, {"m": "n(ez:e)", "e": "1f443", "t": {"es": "nariz", "en": "nose"}}, {"m": "cl(é:e)", "e": "1f511", "t": {"es": "llave", "en": "key"}}, {"m": "p(a:a)rl(er:e)", "e": "1f5e3", "t": {"es": "hablar", "en": "to speak"}}]},
      {"tipo": "mezcla", "m": "p(a:a)rl(er:e)", "t": {"es": "hablar", "en": "to speak"}},
      {"tipo": "toca_sonido", "sonido": "e", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Cuál tiene la é de bébé?", "en": "Which one has the é in bébé?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "n(ez:e)", "e": "1f443"}, {"m": "l(u:u)n(e:_)", "e": "1f319"}, {"m": "l(ou:ou)(p:_)", "e": "1f43a"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "elige_significado", "m": "(et:e)", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Qué significa?", "en": "What does it mean?"}, "opciones": [{"es": "y", "en": "and"}, {"es": "es", "en": "is"}, {"es": "el", "en": "the"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "construye", "m": "b(é:e)b(é:e)", "fichas": ["b", "é", "b", "é", "e"]},
      {"tipo": "construye", "m": "cl(é:e)", "fichas": ["c", "l", "é", "u"]},
      {"tipo": "repite", "m": "p(a:a)rl(er:e)", "t": {"es": "hablar", "en": "to speak"}}
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "u04.l02",
     "titulo": {"es": "le, les · de, des", "en": "le, les · de, des"},
     "pasos": [
      {"tipo": "mira", "m": "(ch:=)(e:schwa)v(a:a)l", "sonido": "schwa", "texto": {"es": "La e sin tilde de le, de, je es suave y corta, con los labios relajados. A veces casi desaparece.", "en": "The e without an accent in le, de, je is soft and short, like the a in about, with relaxed lips. Sometimes it almost disappears."}},
      {"tipo": "escucha", "palabras": [{"m": "(ch:=)(e:schwa)v(a:a)l", "e": "1f434", "t": {"es": "caballo", "en": "horse"}}, {"m": "p(e:schwa)t(i:i)(t:_)", "t": {"es": "pequeño", "en": "small (masculine)"}}, {"m": "l(e:schwa)", "t": {"es": "el", "en": "the"}}, {"m": "l(es:e)", "t": {"es": "los / las", "en": "the (plural)"}}]},
      {"tipo": "lumo", "pose": "pensando", "texto": {"es": "Truco: le y de llevan la e suave. Les y des suenan con la é de bébé: la s no se oye, pero cambia la vocal.", "en": "Trick: le and de have the soft e. Les and des have the é of bébé: the s is silent, but it changes the vowel."}},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "les", "pregunta": {"es": "¿le o les?", "en": "le or les?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "l(e:schwa)"}, {"m": "l(es:e)"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "de", "pregunta": {"es": "¿de o des?", "en": "de or des?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "d(e:schwa)"}, {"m": "d(es:e)"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "me", "pregunta": {"es": "¿me o mes?", "en": "me or mes?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "m(e:schwa)"}, {"m": "m(es:e)"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "des", "pregunta": {"es": "¿de o des?", "en": "de or des?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "d(es:e)"}, {"m": "d(e:schwa)"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "toca_sonido", "sonido": "schwa", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Cuál tiene la e suave de cheval?", "en": "Which one has the soft e in cheval?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "p(e:schwa)t(i:i)(t:_)"}, {"m": "c(a:a)f(é:e)", "e": "2615"}, {"m": "b(é:e)b(é:e)", "e": "1f476"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "cambia", "de": "l(es:e)", "a": "d(es:e)", "opciones": ["l", "d", "m"]},
      {"tipo": "repite", "m": "p(e:schwa)t(i:i)(t:_)", "t": {"es": "pequeño", "en": "small (masculine)"}}
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "u04.l03",
     "titulo": {"es": "è, ê, ai, ei", "en": "è, ê, ai, ei"},
     "pasos": [
      {"tipo": "mira", "m": "fr(ai:eh)s(e:_)", "sonido": "eh", "texto": {"es": "La è de fraise (fresa) es más abierta, como la e de perro. Se escribe è, ê, ai o ei.", "en": "The è of fraise (strawberry) is more open, like the e in bed. It's written è, ê, ai or ei."}},
      {"tipo": "escucha", "palabras": [{"m": "m(è:eh)r(e:_)", "t": {"es": "madre", "en": "mother"}}, {"m": "f(ê:eh)t(e:_)", "e": "1f389", "t": {"es": "fiesta", "en": "party"}}, {"m": "l(ai:eh)(t:_)", "e": "1f95b", "t": {"es": "leche", "en": "milk"}}, {"m": "n(ei:eh)g(e:_)", "e": "2744", "t": {"es": "nieve", "en": "snow"}}]},
      {"tipo": "mezcla", "m": "l(ai:eh)(t:_)", "t": {"es": "leche", "en": "milk"}},
      {"tipo": "toca_sonido", "sonido": "eh", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Cuál tiene la è de fraise?", "en": "Which one has the è in fraise?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "z(è:eh)br(e:_)", "e": "1f993"}, {"m": "b(é:e)b(é:e)", "e": "1f476"}, {"m": "l(u:u)n(e:_)", "e": "1f319"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "escucha_elige", "audio": "lait", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Qué oíste?", "en": "What did you hear?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "l(ai:eh)(t:_)", "e": "1f95b"}, {"m": "l(u:u)"}, {"m": "l(ou:ou)(p:_)", "e": "1f43a"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "elige_significado", "m": "l(ai:eh)(t:_)", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Qué significa?", "en": "What does it mean?"}, "opciones": [{"es": "leche", "en": "milk"}, {"es": "lado", "en": "side"}, {"es": "lago", "en": "lake"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "construye", "m": "m(è:eh)r(e:_)", "fichas": ["m", "è", "r", "e", "a"]},
      {"tipo": "cambia", "de": "f(ê:eh)t(e:_)", "a": "t(ê:eh)t(e:_)", "opciones": ["f", "t", "b"]},
      {"tipo": "repite", "m": "f(ê:eh)t(e:_)", "t": {"es": "fiesta", "en": "party"}}
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "u04.l04",
     "titulo": {"es": "Las tres e", "en": "The three e's"},
     "pasos": [
      {"tipo": "toca_sonido", "sonido": "e", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Cuál tiene la é de bébé?", "en": "Which one has the é in bébé?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "n(ez:e)", "e": "1f443"}, {"m": "m(è:eh)r(e:_)"}, {"m": "l(e:schwa)"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "toca_sonido", "sonido": "eh", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Cuál tiene la è de fraise?", "en": "Which one has the è in fraise?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "cl(é:e)", "e": "1f511"}, {"m": "n(ei:eh)g(e:_)", "e": "2744"}, {"m": "p(e:schwa)t(i:i)(t:_)"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "toca_sonido", "sonido": "schwa", "pregunta": {"es": "¿Cuál tiene la e suave de cheval?", "en": "Which one has the soft e in cheval?"}, "opciones": [{"m": "c(a:a)f(é:e)", "e": "2615"}, {"m": "(ch:=)(e:schwa)v(a:a)l", "e": "1f434"}, {"m": "l(ai:eh)(t:_)", "e": "1f95b"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "mira", "m": "(e:eh)(st:_)", "sonido": "eh", "texto": {"es": "Est (es, está) suena con la è de fraise: la s y la t no suenan. No lo confundas con et (y), que suena é.", "en": "Est (is) has the è of fraise: the s and t are silent. Don't mix it up with et (and), which sounds é."}},
      {"tipo": "construye", "m": "m(e:eh)r", "fichas": ["m", "e", "r", "è", "a"]},
      {"tipo": "lee", "m": "L(e:schwa) b(é:e)b(é:e) (a:a) b(u:u) d(u:u) l(ai:eh)(t:_).", "t": {"es": "El bebé tomó leche.", "en": "The baby drank milk."}, "pregunta": {"es": "¿Qué tomó el bebé?", "en": "What did the baby drink?"}, "opciones": [{"e": "2615"}, {"e": "1f95b"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "lee", "m": "M(a:a) m(è:eh)r(e:_) (e:eh)(st:_) (à:a) l(a:a) f(ê:eh)t(e:_).", "t": {"es": "Mi mamá está en la fiesta.", "en": "My mom is at the party."}, "pregunta": {"es": "¿Dónde está mi mamá?", "en": "Where is my mom?"}, "opciones": [{"e": "1f389"}, {"e": "1f30a"}], "correcta": 0},
      {"tipo": "lee", "m": "(I:i)l (y:i) (a:a) d(e:schwa) l(a:a) n(ei:eh)g(e:_).", "t": {"es": "Hay nieve.", "en": "There is snow."}, "pregunta": {"es": "¿Qué hay?", "en": "What is there?"}, "opciones": [{"e": "1f525"}, {"e": "2744"}], "correcta": 1},
      {"tipo": "repite", "m": "M(a:a) m(è:eh)r(e:_) (e:eh)(st:_) (à:a) l(a:a) f(ê:eh)t(e:_).", "t": {"es": "Mi mamá está en la fiesta.", "en": "My mom is at the party."}},
